Wrote coder-2.json with one row for `education-library-books`. All three passages evidence HB 1447 (2023, "Education matters"): the roll call vote is `multi-subject` (bundles the library chapter with unrelated survey-privacy, patriotic-observance, and obscenity provisions), the sponsorship record is `off`-question (its digest covers only the survey provision), and the enacted school-library text (IC 20-26-5.5) is `direction-only` — it creates a parent/community removal-request-plus-governing-body-review process but doesn't match any single rung clause-for-clause. Row is BLANK `direction-only`, with `needs_source` flagging the missing floor statement and pre-conference bill text.
